</header><div class="entry-content">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our API tutorials have been designed to walk you through the individual steps on using our API. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Learn how to collect authenticated ORCID iD’s from your researchers and reduce the administrative burden for them by reading and writing to and from their ORCID records. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Also learn how to search ORCID records and how to customise your researchers user experience via the <a href="https://info.orcid.org/documentation/integration-and-api-faq/#easy-faq-2537" data-wpel-link="internal">OAuth process</a>. </p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><a href="https://info.orcid.org/documentation/api-tutorials/api-tutorial-get-and-authenticated-orcid-id/" data-wpel-link="internal">Getting an Authenticated ORCID iD</a></li>



<li><a href="https://info.orcid.org/documentation/api-tutorials/api-tutorial-read-data-on-a-record/" data-wpel-link="internal">Reading Data on a Record</a></li>



<li><a href="https://info.orcid.org/documentation/api-tutorials/api-tutorial-add-and-update-data-on-an-orcid-record/" data-wpel-link="internal">Adding and Updating Data</a></li>



<li><a href="https://info.orcid.org/documentation/api-tutorials/api-tutorial-searching-the-orcid-registry/" data-wpel-link="internal">Searching the ORCID Registry</a></li>



<li><a href="https://info.orcid.org/documentation/api-tutorials/api-tutorial-registering-a-notification-webhook/" data-wpel-link="internal">Registering a Notification Webhook</a></li>



<li><a href="https://info.orcid.org/hands-on-with-the-orcid-api/" data-wpel-link="internal">Hands on with the ORCID API</a></li>
</ul>
</div></article></main><aside class="sidebar sidebar-primary widget-area" role="complementary" aria-label="Primary Sidebar" id="genesis-sidebar-primary"><h2 class="genesis-sidebar-title screen-reader-text">Primary Sidebar</h2><section id="search-7" class="widget widget_search"><div class="widget-wrap"><h3 class="widgettitle widget-title">Search</h3>
